### Options

And lastly, we configure the criteria to group the tasks that are close by. For our example, we specify a diameter of 200 meters to group any tasks located close to each other :

```json
"options":{
   "grouping":{
       "order_grouping":{
           "grouping_diameter":200
   }
   }
 }
